// Expected: c1 at one session and at two, also under --auto-queries.
//
// Alice leaks her only secret, and the scenario binds it to itself, which
// changes nothing: every copy of Alice still holds and leaks secret. The
// automatic queries once left out every constant a scenario names as a
// target, so this model was analyzed with no query at all and
// --fail-on-attack exited successfully.
attacker[passive]
principal Alice[
	knows private secret
	leaks secret
]
scenarios[Alice[secret = secret]]
queries[
	confidentiality? secret
]
